# Doodle Dash

Draw & Guess — a real-time multiplayer drawing game built with Next.js and Pusher Channels.

## Environment Variables

Copy `.env.example` to `.env.local` and fill in your Pusher credentials:

```
PUSHER_APP_ID=
PUSHER_KEY=
PUSHER_SECRET=
PUSHER_CLUSTER=
NEXT_PUBLIC_PUSHER_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_PUSHER_CLUSTER=
```

Get free credentials at [pusher.com](https://pusher.com).
